  {
    "section": "power-moves",
    "claim": "In the sharpest positions \u2014 where one move beats every alternative by more than a whole piece \u2014 the winning move is not a strike about a quarter of the time. Those are the moves a club player never looks at, because nothing is being taken. Positions where the best move settles the game outright are counted separately: there the gap is a mate margin, not an amount of material.",
